  m_Text: 'A quiet grassland beneath a real-time sky and Moon,

    aligned to a
    globally shared observation location.


    A meteor event begins at the top
    of every hour.

    Seasonal showers appear when active;

    otherwise sporadic
    meteors cross the sky.


    Relax, chat, sleep in VR, watch videos, draw, or
    take photos.

    PC / Android / iOS'
